    "uiMetaData": {
      "title": "Root Container",
      "description": "Hedera Guardian policy implementing the CDM AMS-III.AV v9.0 small-scale methodology jointly with Verra VMR0015 v1.0 for safe-drinking-water projects. Computes Emission Reductions (ERy = BEy \u2212 PEy \u2212 LEy) from project-monitored water volume, fraction boiling, fNRB, and grid-energy data, and mints VCU-SDW tokens (1 token = 1 tCO2e). 5% of every issuance is routed to a buffer-pool token (VCU-SDW-BUFFER) per VMR0015 \u00a76 risk-management rules. All inputs are oracle-attested via HCS-10, multi-signed by accredited VVBs, and OWNER-confirmed before mint",
      "type": "blank"
    },
    "onErrorAction": "no-action",
